# Paper sources stay local; only the compiled PDF (docs/paper/technical_report.pdf) is published
docs/TECHNICAL_REPORT.md
docs/paper/*.tex

# Raw screen recordings (the README uses docs/media/demo.gif)
docs/*.mov

